#: .\navigator\services\featherless_ai.py:24
msgid "I'm sorry, I lost my connection for a moment. Could we try that again?"
msgstr "Sorry nimelose connection kwa moment. Tujaribu tena?"

#: .\navigator\services\featherless_ai.py:269
msgid "it does not appear to address your stated situation"
msgstr "haielewi situation yako"

#: .\navigator\services\featherless_ai.py:272
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The document you provided does not seem to contain the right information for "
"your situation because %(reason)s."
msgstr ""
"Document uli-submit haionekani kuwa na info sahihi kwa situation yako kwa "
"sababu %(reason)s."

#: .\navigator\services\featherless_ai.py:278
msgid ""
"This document also doesn't seem to match. Try searching the official portal "
"for your program or looking for eligibility guidelines and application "
"requirements."
msgstr ""
"Hii document pia haifit. Jaribu kutafuta official portal ya program yako au "
"eligibility guidelines na application requirements."

#: .\navigator\services\featherless_ai.py:283
msgid ""
"We've tried several documents that still don't match your situation. Please "
"look for the official program page, eligibility guidelines, or application "
"requirements from a trusted government or institution source."
msgstr ""
"Tumetry documents kadhaa na bado hazifit situation yako. Tafuta official "
"program page, eligibility guidelines, au application requirements kutoka "
"trusted government au institution."

#: .\navigator\services\featherless_ai.py:292
msgid ""
"I couldn't extract clear eligibility rules from this document. Please try a "
"more complete policy page, official program guidelines, or a readable PDF/"
"Word document."
msgstr ""
"Sikuweza extract clear eligibility rules kutoka document hii. Jaribu policy "
"page iliyo complete, official program guidelines, au readable PDF/Word doc."

#: .\navigator\services\featherless_ai.py:692
msgid "I've reviewed your policy document against what you've shared so far."
msgstr "Nime-review policy document yako ukilinganisha na ulicho-share hadi sasa."

#: .\navigator\services\featherless_ai.py:696
#, python-format
msgid "Thanks — that clarifies %(label)s."
msgstr "Asante — hiyo ina-clarify %(label)s."

#: .\navigator\services\featherless_ai.py:698
msgid "Thanks — that helps clarify several of these points."
msgstr "Asante — hiyo inasaidia ku-clarify points kadhaa hapa."

#: .\navigator\services\featherless_ai.py:708
#, python-format
msgid "Can you confirm: %(label)s?"
msgstr "Unaweza confirm: %(label)s?"

#: .\navigator\services\featherless_ai.py:711
msgid ""
"To check your eligibility based on this document, I need to know a few "
"specific things:"
msgstr ""
"Ili ku-check eligibility yako based on document hii, nahitaji kujua vitu "
"specific kadhaa:"

#: .\navigator\services\featherless_ai.py:717
#, python-format
msgid "* …and %(count)s other requirement(s)."
msgstr "* …na requirements %(count)s zingine."

#: .\navigator\services\featherless_ai.py:720
msgid "Please provide these details in your next message."
msgstr "Tafadhali provide details hizi kwa next message yako."

#: .\navigator\services\featherless_ai.py:1293
msgid ""
"I can't answer that safely from the policy document alone. Please check the "
"official program website or contact the relevant office for confirmation."
msgstr ""
"Siwezi answer hiyo safely kutoka policy document pekee. Check official program "
"website au contact relevant office kwa confirmation."

#: .\navigator\services\featherless_ai.py:277
msgid "Could not parse the relevance evaluation."
msgstr "Haikuwezekana ku-parse relevance evaluation."

#: .\navigator\services\featherless_ai.py:354
msgid "no readable policy text could be extracted from the submission"
msgstr "hakuna readable policy text iliweza extract kutoka submission"

#: .\navigator\services\featherless_ai.py:1324
msgid ""
"I don't have the policy document available to answer that safely. Please check "
"the official program website or contact the relevant office directly."
msgstr ""
"Sina policy document available ku-answer hiyo safely. Check official program "
"website au contact relevant office directly."

